Z||000000||fiero_hunter85||09-10-2001||07:33 PM||||before i noticed rust stains on my dash so yesterday i took off my sunroof and i found out that the metel under the weather stripping is tottally rusted out.  is there any way i can fix it withoput getting a new roof pannel?||||reg||1
Z||000001||mbramble||09-10-2001||08:56 PM||||There are 4 pieces of channel for holding the gasket.  They are riveted to the skin and each has at least on bolt thru it that comes from the inside of the roof.  They can be replaced, it's just a matter of finding replacements.  I found the two pieces that I needed off a smashed up Fiero at the u-pull-it.  You might try the local yards or see if someone can help you out in the Mall.  I don't know if you can buy the pieces new or not.  <P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||fiero_hunter85||09-11-2001||09:45 AM||||ok thanx, if i cant find any at the bone yard i will probably just fill it up with clear cylicone. <BR>i have never taken apart a fiero roof so im not use to that part yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
